---
// Social Proof & Customer Outcomes Component — Real Metrics & Case Studies
---

<section id="reviews" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14 sm:mb-18">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-amber-800 mb-4">
        <span>Verified Customer Results</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#100F12] tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] leading-[1.12]">
        Real teams. Measurable revenue growth.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#5F5E6E] leading-relaxed">
        See how high-growth businesses use NewRelay to speed up replies, delight customers, and build 5-star brand reputations.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Highlight Metric Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-14">
      
      <div class="bg-[#FAF9FF] rounded-2xl border border-purple-100 p-6 text-center">
        <p class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[#635BFF] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">+140%</p>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12] mt-2">More Google & Trustpilot Reviews</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#5F5E6E] mt-1">Automated post-purchase review invites</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#FAF9FF] rounded-2xl border border-purple-100 p-6 text-center">
        <p class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-emerald-600 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">-68%</p>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12] mt-2">Average First Response Time</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#5F5E6E] mt-1">Smart routing & 24/7 auto-qualification</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#FAF9FF] rounded-2xl border border-purple-100 p-6 text-center">
        <p class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-amber-500 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">99.2%</p>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12] mt-2">Customer Satisfaction (CSAT)</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#5F5E6E] mt-1">Across 4.2M+ resolved conversations</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 3 Authentic Testimonial Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 p-7 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#100F12] leading-relaxed font-medium">
            "We cut customer response times from 3 hours to 4 minutes and doubled our Google reviews in 60 days. Our WhatsApp sales conversions are up 40%."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/673442f44c948080a43e913b/673592bcb033b09ad5f3ed3f_user-1.png" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover" alt="Elena Rostova" />
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-[#100F12]">Elena Rostova</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-[#5F5E6E]">VP Operations, SwiftRetail</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-purple-200 p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between relative">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#100F12] leading-relaxed font-medium">
            "Our agents close 35% more high-value buyer inquiries because NewRelay routes leads to the right agent in under 20 seconds. The collision detection is a lifesaver."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/673442f44c948080a43e913b/673592bcafb16ca7bb760d97_user-2.png" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover" alt="Julian Thorne" />
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-[#100F12]">Julian Thorne</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-[#5F5E6E]">Co-Founder, Crestline Homes</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 p-7 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#100F12] leading-relaxed font-medium">
            "Patients love booking and confirming appointments on WhatsApp. Our no-show rate dropped by 42% in month one, and collecting reviews has never been simpler."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/673442f44c948080a43e913b/673592bc40140078962527b6_user-3.png" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover" alt="Dr. Clara Vance" />
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-[#100F12]">Dr. Clara Vance</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-[#5F5E6E]">Clinic Director, Lumina Health</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>
